			<name>Improved Evasion (Ex)</name>
			<description>You can avoid damage from many area-effect attacks. If you make a successful Reflex save against an attack that normally deals half damage on a successful save, you instead take no damage, and even on a failed saving throw you take only half damage. If you are helpless, you do not gain the benefit of improved evasion.</description>
			<type>SPECIALQUALITY.EXTRAORDINARY.DEFENSIVE.ADVANCEDROGUETALENT.ROGUECLASSFEATURES.RANGERCLASSFEATURES.MONKCLASSFEATURES</type>
